depends: plus, integer
- ctx D2 ≔ ε ᐅ z:Int[]
- ctx D3 ≔ D2 ᐅ rep:ℕ ⨯ ℕ ᐅ p:ℕ ⨯ ℕ ᐅ q:ℕ ⨯ ℕ
- ctx D4 ≔ ε ᐅ a:ℕ ᐅ ap:ℕ ᐅ ihOuter:((bp:ℕ) → (plus[] ((normPair[] ap bp).π₁) bp ≡ plus[] ((normPair[] ap bp).π₂) ap ∈ ℕ))
- ctx D5 ≔ D2 ᐅ a:ℕ ⨯ ℕ ᐅ ap:ℕ ⨯ ℕ ᐅ ra:(plus[] (a.π₁) (ap.π₂) ≡ plus[] (a.π₂) (ap.π₁) ∈ ℕ)
- el-nat-e ε ᐅ a:ℕ ᐅ n2:ℕ ᐅ ih2:(ℕ → ℕ ⨯ ℕ) ᐅ bb:ℕ ⊦ ℕ-elim (S n2 , Z) (bb2 ih3. (ih2 bb2)) bb motive (bb2 ih3. ℕ ⨯ ℕ)
- el-nat-e ε ᐅ a:ℕ ⊦ ℕ-elim (λb. (Z , b)) (n2 ih2. (λbb. (ℕ-elim (S n2 , Z) (bb2 ih3. (ih2 bb2)) bb))) a motive (n2 ih2. ℕ → ℕ ⨯ ℕ)
- ty-eq-cong ε ᐅ bp:ℕ ⊦ plus[] bp Z ≡ plus[] bp Z ∈ ℕ ≐ plus[] Z bp ≡ plus[] bp Z ∈ ℕ
- el-ty-coe ε ᐅ bp:ℕ ⊦ Refl : plus[] bp Z ≡ plus[] bp Z ∈ ℕ ↝ plus[] Z bp ≡ plus[] bp Z ∈ ℕ
- el-pi-i ε ⊦ λbp. Refl : (bp:ℕ) → (plus[] Z bp ≡ plus[] bp Z ∈ ℕ)
- sig ε ⊦ normPair ≔ λa. (ℕ-elim (λbb. (Z , bb)) (n2 ih2. (λbb. (ℕ-elim (S n2 , Z) (bb2 ih3. (ih2 bb2)) bb))) a) : ℕ → ℕ → ℕ ⨯ ℕ
- el-reflect D4 ᐅ bq:ℕ ⊦ zeroPlusId[S ap] : (plus[] Z (S ap) ≡ S ap ∈ ℕ) reflect
- ty-eq-cong D4 ᐅ bq:ℕ ⊦ plus[] (S ap) Z ≡ plus[] (S ap) Z ∈ ℕ ≐ plus[] (S ap) Z ≡ plus[] Z (S ap) ∈ ℕ
- el-ty-coe D4 ᐅ bq:ℕ ⊦ Refl : plus[] (S ap) Z ≡ plus[] (S ap) Z ∈ ℕ ↝ plus[] (S ap) Z ≡ plus[] Z (S ap) ∈ ℕ
- el-reflect D4 ᐅ bq:ℕ ᐅ bb:ℕ ⊦ ihOuter bb : (plus[] ((normPair[] ap bb).π₁) bb ≡ plus[] ((normPair[] ap bb).π₂) ap ∈ ℕ) reflect
- el-suc-cong D4 ᐅ bq:ℕ ᐅ bb:ℕ ⊦ S (plus[] ((normPair[] ap bb).π₁) bb) ≐ S (plus[] ((normPair[] ap bb).π₂) ap)
- el-pi-e D4 ᐅ bq:ℕ ᐅ bb:ℕ ⊦ plus[] ((normPair[] ap bb).π₁) (S bb)
- ty-eq-cong D4 ᐅ bq:ℕ ᐅ bb:ℕ ⊦ plus[] ((normPair[] ap bb).π₁) (S bb) ≡ plus[] ((normPair[] ap bb).π₁) (S bb) ∈ ℕ ≐ plus[] ((normPair[] ap bb).π₁) (S bb) ≡ plus[] ((normPair[] ap bb).π₂) (S ap) ∈ ℕ
- el-ty-coe D4 ᐅ bq:ℕ ᐅ bb:ℕ ⊦ Refl : plus[] ((normPair[] ap bb).π₁) (S bb) ≡ plus[] ((normPair[] ap bb).π₁) (S bb) ∈ ℕ ↝ plus[] ((normPair[] ap bb).π₁) (S bb) ≡ plus[] ((normPair[] ap bb).π₂) (S ap) ∈ ℕ
- el-nat-e D4 ᐅ bq:ℕ ⊦ ℕ-elim (Refl) (bb ihd. Refl) bq motive (bq2 ihd2. (plus[] ((normPair[] (S ap) bq2).π₁) bq2 ≡ plus[] ((normPair[] (S ap) bq2).π₂) (S ap) ∈ ℕ))
- el-pi-i D4 ⊦ λbq. (ℕ-elim (Refl) (bb ihd. Refl) bq) : (bp:ℕ) → (plus[] ((normPair[] (S ap) bp).π₁) bp ≡ plus[] ((normPair[] (S ap) bp).π₂) (S ap) ∈ ℕ)
- el-nat-e ε ᐅ a:ℕ ⊦ ℕ-elim (λbp. Refl) (ap ihOuter. (λbq. (ℕ-elim (Refl) (bb ihd. Refl) bq))) a motive (a2 ihO. ((bp:ℕ) → (plus[] ((normPair[] a2 bp).π₁) bp ≡ plus[] ((normPair[] a2 bp).π₂) a2 ∈ ℕ)))
- el-pi-i ε ⊦ λa. (ℕ-elim (λbp. Refl) (ap ihOuter. (λbq. (ℕ-elim (Refl) (bb ihd. Refl) bq))) a) : (a2:ℕ) → ((bp:ℕ) → (plus[] ((normPair[] a2 bp).π₁) bp ≡ plus[] ((normPair[] a2 bp).π₂) a2 ∈ ℕ))
- sig ε ⊦ normPreservesClassFn ≔ λa. (ℕ-elim (λbp. Refl) (ap ihOuter. (λbq. (ℕ-elim (Refl) (bb ihd. Refl) bq))) a) : (a2:ℕ) → ((bp:ℕ) → (plus[] ((normPair[] a2 bp).π₁) bp ≡ plus[] ((normPair[] a2 bp).π₂) a2 ∈ ℕ))
- el-pi-e D3 ⊦ plus[] (p.π₁) (q.π₂)
- el-pi-e D3 ⊦ plus[] (p.π₂) (q.π₁)
- el-pi-e D2 ᐅ p:ℕ ⨯ ℕ ᐅ q:ℕ ⨯ ℕ ⊦ plus[] (p.π₁) (q.π₂)
- el-pi-e D2 ᐅ p:ℕ ⨯ ℕ ᐅ q:ℕ ⨯ ℕ ⊦ plus[] (p.π₂) (q.π₁)
- el-pi-e D5 ᐅ p:ℕ ⨯ ℕ ᐅ q:ℕ ⨯ ℕ ⊦ plus[] (p.π₁) (q.π₂)
- el-pi-e D5 ᐅ p:ℕ ⨯ ℕ ᐅ q:ℕ ⨯ ℕ ⊦ plus[] (p.π₂) (q.π₁)
- el-quot-eq D5 ⊦ class (normPair[] (a.π₁) (a.π₂)) ≐ class a : (ℕ ⨯ ℕ) / (p q. (plus[] (p.π₁) (q.π₂) ≡ plus[] (p.π₂) (q.π₁) ∈ ℕ)) via (normPreservesClassFn[] (a.π₁)) (a.π₂)
- el-quot-eq D5 ⊦ class (normPair[] (ap.π₁) (ap.π₂)) ≐ class ap : (ℕ ⨯ ℕ) / (p q. (plus[] (p.π₁) (q.π₂) ≡ plus[] (p.π₂) (q.π₁) ∈ ℕ)) via (normPreservesClassFn[] (ap.π₁)) (ap.π₂)
- el-quot-eq D5 ⊦ class a ≐ class ap : (ℕ ⨯ ℕ) / (p q. (plus[] (p.π₁) (q.π₂) ≡ plus[] (p.π₂) (q.π₁) ∈ ℕ)) via ra
- el-eq-trans D5 ⊦ class (normPair[] (a.π₁) (a.π₂)) ≐ class ap : (ℕ ⨯ ℕ) / (p q. (plus[] (p.π₁) (q.π₂) ≡ plus[] (p.π₂) (q.π₁) ∈ ℕ)) via class a
- el-eq-trans D5 ⊦ class (normPair[] (a.π₁) (a.π₂)) ≐ class (normPair[] (ap.π₁) (ap.π₂)) : (ℕ ⨯ ℕ) / (p q. (plus[] (p.π₁) (q.π₂) ≡ plus[] (p.π₂) (q.π₁) ∈ ℕ)) via class ap
- el-quot-elim D2 ⊦ quot-elim (rep. class (normPair[] (rep.π₁) (rep.π₂))) (z : (ℕ ⨯ ℕ) / (p q. (plus[] (p.π₁) (q.π₂) ≡ plus[] (p.π₂) (q.π₁) ∈ ℕ))) motive (q1. Int[])
- sig ε ⊦ intNormalize ≔ λz. (quot-elim (rep. class (normPair[] (rep.π₁) (rep.π₂))) z) : (Int[]) → Int[]
